rigor/shots/

# --- transient tooling output ----------------------------------------------
rigor/review_packet_*.md


# --- companion private repository -------------------------------------------
# The non-publishable material lives in a second git dir over the SAME work tree
# (see PRIVATE.md, tracked only there).  Nothing moves; both repos see one tree.
/.git-private/
/PRIVATE.md
/CHECKLIST.md

